      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUSTENUFFSPLASH (5) starting to build a good winning CV. Sharp drop in class third up with a gritty nose victory over 1175m at Albury on a heavy (9) track. Hard to stop in this vein of form and adept in all conditions. PEACE BIRD (2) consistent mare chasing her third straight victory. Undefeated in two starts at this track and looks up to this stronger contest with Cole's 2kg claim. Another bold showing is on the cards. OUI FLOURISH (8) lightly raced mare resuming. Ran some nice races in town and on the provincial circuit last prep and fitted with the two good trials. Makes plenty of appeal from the good gate. THE EYES HAVE IT (4) is holding her form and not to be overlooked.",
